ch, Cajun/Creole, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":7},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"yf8a1DOlqoqlKHuLSKEfxg","review_id":"nmI3UaR-iGhHvQnwNOW1Dg","date":"2013-02-19T05:34:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9495056867599487,"text_excerpt":"Of all the places I ate at in New Orleans, Dante's Kitchen was my favorite! We came here for Sunday brunch before the Chargers/Saints game. It's a bit out of the way but def. worth the trip. This is an adorable converted home. It has small bar when you walk in and a nice patio outside where we were seated. We did have quite the wait, so we sipped on some Bloody Marys while we waited on a stoop across the street. After finally being seated we looked over the menu and I knew immediately what I was going to order: Eggs Benedict! They were the best Eggs Benedict I've ever had. They came on a homemade biscuit, not an English muffin. My cousin ordered the Crab & Brie omelette which was light an..."},{"business_id":"yf8a1DOlqoqlKHuLSKEfxg","review_id":"xZxuhvV6nKxMtAg_iddt8A","date":"2015-03-27T13:21:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9480689167976379,"text_excerpt":"I have been to Dante's a few times for brunch and years ago for lunch. This review is of the brunch only. It's definitely a winner. I went most recently on a beautiful Sunday morning after Mass. We were first in line and chose the patio of course. NOLA had just been through a wet cold spell, and the idea of patio dining was exciting. We both ordered a Bloody Mary to start. It is one of the best Bloodies in the city. The difference is a nice hint of horseradish in the mix. Very tasty. For food, I ordered the pork steak confit and my lovely dining companion the salmon and eggs. The pork confit was one of the best dishes I have eaten, truly a first class dish. It was perfectly tender and ser..."},{"business_id":"yf8a1DOlqoqlKHuLSKEfxg","review_id":"rygjKJns9CI8OKwhqeCQrA","date":"2011-10-24T23:36:33","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9479628801345825,"text_excerpt":"After some debate and scrolling around on the Yelp app on our phones we found ourselves at Dante's Kitchen. It was a Sunday night, we took a chance without a reservation. We were seated in this cute little dining room in the back. Drinks: we ordered a round of the house sangria. After days of gorging on NOLA sized portions we decided to share some apps and entree's. Here's what we had: Grilled shrimp with andouille red eye gravy over grits Duck fat roasted smashed new potatoes with bacon and onions Tuna two ways Redfish on the halfshell Stuffed eggplant Slow cooked duck breast w/ smoked peaches, parsnip puree and crispy parsnips Two hot cast iron skillets with spoon bread came out first. ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"yf8a1DOlqoqlKHuLSKEfxg","photo_id":"-gCjWllmENe3inohylAk_g","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/-gCjWllmENe3inohylAk_g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8675113320350647},{"business_id":"yf8a1DOlqoqlKHuLSKEfxg","photo_id":"LCh-6QT9wJW4eYnyILvykA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/LCh-6QT9wJW4eYnyILvykA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.832040011882782},{"business_id":"yf8a1DOlqoqlKHuLSKEfxg","photo_id":"U6Zuj-jqrxpg3y86Iy693w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/U6Zuj-jqrxpg3y86Iy693w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7898335456848145},{"business_id":"yf8a1DOlqoqlKHuLSKEfxg","photo_id":"LQiPzEwyFLPsIaaGF83m6g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LQiPzEwyFLPsIaaGF83m6g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.778854250907898},{"business_id":"yf8a1DOlqoqlKHuLSKEfxg","photo_id":"XjpHQZXI-i8uE3RbGtA1fg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/XjpHQZXI-i8uE3RbGtA1fg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7463314533233643}]},"notebook_case":null}
